Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Rasguei a minha meia calça...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sinto muito por você, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Esta é uma sala de aula,\N e há muitos garotos aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que você está sentada assim?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.81,0:00:47.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vou tirá-los!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabei de falar qu—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso foi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Aah, que azar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você está falando,\N agora as pessoas vão reparar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é completamente sua culpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Calma, agora estamos iguais.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Não há nada de bom nisso!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Já estão se divertindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yua-chan, Bom dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yua!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Adivinha o que ela fez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yua, sua...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:42.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tive tempo de trocá-las, eu estava atrasada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Estamos combinado!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Você tem que cuidar das suas unhas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Afinal, você faz cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,E isso importa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que isso teve que acontecer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:01.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu estou com fome...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu pulei o café da manhã também...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:05.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,É quase inacreditável ter amigas\N passando pelo o mesmo que eu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:11.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu terminei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yua, mais rápido, mais rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Não me apresse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Se eu rasgar de nov—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Ren-chan, uhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.09,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você acha que está fazendo!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Dizem que há punição de quem ri dos outros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Nunca ouvi nada do tipo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:48.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Hum, hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é justo só vocês duas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é pesada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei! Onde você está me tocando?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:03:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yoshitomo e o General Nobuyori\N venceram a batalha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:02.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}contra Michinori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:03.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mas,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kiyomori venceu com um poder maior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}E Yoritomo,\N filho de Yoshitomo…
